# Big gameplay videos belong on YouTube, not in the repo:
# GitHub hard-rejects any file over 100 MB, and heavy files make the
# site slow. For anything large, paste the YouTube ID into js/data.js
# (the site prefers it over a local file). Keep local clips small.
# .mkv never plays in a browser <video> tag, so never commit it:
*.mkv
